OL,3,AKing 'heartbroken' by deadly Nepal
OL,4,Aflash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King says he and Queen Camilla are
OL,7,F"heartbroken" by the deadly flash
OL,8,Ffloods near the Nepal-Tibet border, as
OL,9,F33 people from the UK are missing
OL,10,Fincluding a 13-year-old girl and
OL,11,F14-year-old boy.
OL,13,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales also
OL,14,Fexpressed their shock, saying they were
OL,15,F"thinking of everyone caught up in this
OL,16,Fterrible disaster".
OL,18,FThe death toll from the floods has
OL,19,Frisen to at least 359, with more than
OL,20,F1,300 people missing, 644 of whom are
OL,21,Ftourists according to Nepali
OL,22,Fauthorities.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
